I see a question from Louis Angelica.

00:15:20.040 --> 00:15:23.330
What's the full reference
for the Brochu 2010 tutorial

00:15:23.330 --> 00:15:25.180
on sequential model based optimization?

00:15:25.180 --> 00:15:26.160
Oh yes.

00:15:26.160 --> 00:15:27.630
So I can't really recall the title,

00:15:27.630 --> 00:15:31.780
but if you Google Brochu 2010
sequential model optimization,

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:33.950
you're going to definitely find it.

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:36.290
If not, I'll try to
actually share these slides

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:37.640
after this talk.

00:15:37.640 --> 00:15:40.910
But then there, I'm going to
